_011CffVKvEKAXZsHw16iVxt6","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd9d2b11-9dff-4171-94d4-7b0de5c9de4b","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:49:31.913Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a4d84e01b97891e91"}
{"parentUuid":"dd9d2b11-9dff-4171-94d4-7b0de5c9de4b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KuNDynY7S7pZTxGatZ9gaJ","type":"tool_result","content":"Usage: agent resume [options]\n\nResume the latest chat session\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help  Display help for command\nUsage: agent create-chat [options]\n\nCreate a new empty chat and return its ID\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help  Display help for command\nCommands:\n  resume  Resume a previous session by id or pick the most recent with --last\n  fork    Fork a previous session by id into a new session\n  review  Run a code review against the current repository\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n--\n      --thread-source <SOURCE>\n          Source classification for newly created or forked threads\n\n      --skip-git-repo-check\n[experimental] Run the app server or related tooling\n\nUsage: codex app-server [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  daemon                Manage the local app-server daemon\n  proxy                 Proxy stdio bytes to the running app-server control socket\n  generate-ts           [experimental] Generate TypeScript bindings for the app server protocol\n  generate-json-schema  [experimental] Generate JSON Schema for the app server protocol\n  help                  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n  -c, --config <key=value>\n          Override a configuration value that would otherwise be loaded from `~/.codex/config.toml`.\n          Use a dotted path (`foo.bar.baz`) to override nested values. The `value` portion is parsed\n          as TOML. If it fails to parse as TOML, the raw string is used as a literal.\n          \n          Examples: - `-c model=\"o3\"` - `-c 'sandbox_permissions=[\"disk-full-read-access\"]'` - `-c\n          shell_environment_policy.inherit=all`\n\n      --enable <FEATURE>\n          Enable a feature (repeatable). Equivalent to `-c features.<name>=true`\n\n      --disable <FEATURE>\n          Disable a feature (repeatable). Equivalent to `-c features.<name>=false`\n\n      --code-mode-host <URL>\n          Connect to a remote code-mode host instead of starting a local host\n\n      --strict-config\n15:| `--resume [chatId]`        | Resume a chat session                                                                                                |\n16:| `--continue`               | Continue the previous session (alias for `--resume=-1`)                                                              |\n48:| `ls`                          | Resume a chat session                                             | `agent ls`                          |\n49:| `resume`                      | Resume the latest chat session                                    | `agent resume`                      |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"26550cfc-eef8-4887-b2d7-e091ac3659f1","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:49:34.448Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"dd9d2b11-9dff-4171-94d4-7b0de5c9de4b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a4d84e01b97891e91"}
