{"parentUuid":"d48758f3-11a9-4b1c-9331-cf603782535d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TdV5W39HpFnZK2uHdquhpd","type":"tool_result","content":"[`tui.resume_cwd`](https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/config-file/config-reference) to `\"current\"` or\n`\"session\"` to reuse that choice without a prompt. An explicit `--cd` (`-C`)\noverride takes precedence over `tui.resume_cwd`.\n\n<ConfigTable client:load options={resumeOptions} />\n\n### `codex fork`\n\nFork a previous interactive session into a new chat. By default, `codex fork` opens the session picker; add `--last` to fork your most recent session instead.\n\nWhen the current and saved session directories differ, `codex fork` uses the\nsame working-directory prompt and `tui.resume_cwd` setting as `codex resume`.\n\n<ConfigTable client:load options={forkOptions} />\n\n### `codex sandbox`\n\n21:flags, follow the relevant command help. For example, `codex exec --oss ...`\n193:### `codex exec`\n195:Use `codex exec` (or the short form `codex e`) for scripted or CI-style runs that should finish without human interaction.\n203:### `codex execpolicy`\n205:Check `execpolicy` rule files before you save them. `codex execpolicy check` accepts one or more `--rules` flags (for example, files under `~/.codex/rules`) and emits JSON showing the strictest decision and any matching rules. Add `--pretty` to format the output. The `execpolicy` command is currently in preview.\n286:### `codex fork`\n519:<a id=\"import-claude-code-configuration-with-import\"></a>\n520:<a id=\"import-claude-code-setup-with-import\"></a>\n521:<a id=\"cli-import-claude-code-setup-with-import\"></a>\n539:<a id=\"clear-the-terminal-and-start-a-new-chat-with-clear\"></a>\n540:<a id=\"clear-the-terminal-and-start-a-new-task-with-clear\"></a>\n772:<a id=\"start-a-new-conversation-with-new\"></a>\n785:<a id=\"rename-the-current-chat-with-rename\"></a>\n786:<a id=\"rename-the-current-task-with-rename\"></a>\n795:<a id=\"resume-a-saved-conversation-with-resume\"></a>\n805:<a id=\"fork-the-current-conversation-with-fork\"></a>\n826:<a id=\"start-a-side-conversation-with-side\"></a>\n2:docs:\n3-  https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks:\n4-    version: 0.159.3\n5-    sha256: 724881d81f1a9fdb35ea42d4851a11b1f6606bbc6e9d2d05c1e8c466fc25c630\n6-  https://developers.openai.com/codex/noninteractive:\n7-    version: 0.159.3\n8-    sha256: c83fe9259825a206d1d4f7a0ac669e5697d270ce2bebd28c5d36ad829c9a2a08","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"604bb601-4de0-4e16-821c-6b84d0580fbc","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:54:42.840Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d48758f3-11a9-4b1c-9331-cf603782535d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
