{"parentUuid":"8e99b716-a6dc-4028-b824-3c150872fe35","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WuNUamyHWVFAugvJJNiQto","type":"tool_result","content":"12:// The recorded runs runs/manual-compaction-auto and runs/manual-compaction-auto-blocked:\n14:// compacts after each of the first three tool results, with a hook on every\n15:// compaction event; and the same turn with a PreCompact hook printing\n16:// `continue: false`. A `codex exec` has no /compact (runs/manual-compaction-slash:\n17:// the text goes to the model), so the scenario asks for a compaction with a\n18:// compact record, the one place the mock departs from the recording.\n19:const compactingScript = `#!/bin/sh\n21:c=$(grep -c '\"type\":\"compacted\"' \"$A10N_MOCK_SESSION_FILE\")\n25:  printf '%s\\n' '{\"type\":\"compact\",\"trigger\":\"auto\"}'\n42:\t\tScript:    compactingScript,\n50:// compactions apart (the trigger, the start's source).\n64:func compactedRecords(rollout string) int { return strings.Count(rollout, `\"type\":\"compacted\"`) }\n66:// Compacting fires PreCompact with the trigger, then records the compaction,\n67:// then fires PostCompact, then SessionStart with source \"compact\"; each of\n70:// sr:proves manual-compaction/codex\n72:\trec, got := replayCompacting(t, \"manual-compaction-auto\")\n77:\tassert.Equal(t, 3, compactedRecords(got.rollout(t)), \"one compaction record each\")\n83:\t\t\tassert.NotContains(t, l, \"permission_mode\", \"a compaction's payload has none\")\n86:\t// the turn goes on past each compaction and ends once\n92:// A PreCompact hook that prints `continue: false` stops the compaction: it is\n96:// runs/manual-compaction-auto-blocked).\n97:// sr:proves manual-compaction/codex\n99:\trec, got := replayCompacting(t, \"manual-compaction-auto-blocked\")\n104:\tassert.Zero(t, compactedRecords(got.rollout(t)), \"nothing was compacted\")\n112:// compaction: it was recorded, but no session start fires, and Codex aborts the\n113:// turn the same way; the session still ends (runs/manual-compaction-auto-post-stopped).\n114:// sr:proves manual-compaction/codex\n116:\trec, got := replayCompacting(t, \"manual-compaction-auto-post-stopped\")\n121:\tassert.Equal(t, 1, compactedRecords(got.rollout(t)), \"the compaction was recorded\")\n127:// A compaction nobody stops is compacted manually when the scenario asks for","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b2ba8a5f-aece-4158-982c-146c84467419","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:46:30.626Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8e99b716-a6dc-4028-b824-3c150872fe35","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-ab095323a3b740c00"}
