{"parentUuid":"65924f22-0f50-4805-9ddb-4c4e96ac06a0","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfft7fmmRGgeG1tYo2A6K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The last `sr-checks` run refused on two things, and I've fixed both and committed.\n\n- **Core marker:** `internal/session/fork_base.go` added session-fork behaviour in core without the `sr:capability` marker. I deleted that file and folded `HistoryBase` and `ForkBase` into the marked `internal/session/fork.go`. There is still exactly one marker. I dropped the unused `Through` helper.\n- **`session-start-hook/codex`, compact source:** the mock fires `compact` but no test marked for this capability checked it. I added `TestCompactionStartsTheSessionWithSourceCompact` in `session_fork_test.go`. It replays the `manual-compaction-auto` recording and asserts the SessionStart sources match it.\n\nBuild, vet and the session, fork and compaction tests pass.\n\nI've started `sr-checks run --base origin/main --head HEAD` in the background. If it comes back clean, I'll push, open the PR, wait for CI and admin-merge. If something still refuses, I'll read it first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":908,"cache_read_input_tokens":309009,"output_tokens":344,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":908},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":344,"cache_read_input_tokens":309009,"cache_creation_input_tokens":908,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":908,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestI