{"parentUuid":"e0ab1f77-d27b-4882-836a-b3a3d1d52ca3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0189PWNWtRNJSEaUrkUrFcwg","type":"tool_result","content":"The Codex doc (hooks#sessionstart) says that when a SessionStart hook matching source \"compact\" returns continue:false, Codex ends the turn without sending another model request, and that its additionalContext reaches the immediate continuation. No test covers that: TestCompactionStartsTheSessionWithSourceCompact only checks the compact source sequence, and TestSessionStartContinueFalseEndsTheTurnNotTheSession only covers continue:false on the startup start. No test sets continue:false on a compact-source SessionStart hook, so this documented variant is unchecked and has no recorded run. The other items are covered: startup, fork, matcher filtering, exit 2 and continue:false at startup. Resume and clear are declared deviations.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f544fd43-54f5-4a34-b678-138b2500706c","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:54:09.366Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e0ab1f77-d27b-4882-836a-b3a3d1d52ca3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-abb30e7cdc8998b15"}
