{"parentUuid":"8452fdc1-3ab9-4870-aae8-98a2ef9b1616","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VTgA3bNqip9CPKriVuc3EF","type":"tool_result","content":"The Codex doc (hooks#sessionstart) says that when a SessionStart hook matching source \"compact\" returns continue:false, Codex ends the turn without sending another model request, and that its additionalContext reaches the immediate continuation. No test covers that: TestCompactionStartsTheSessionWithSourceCompact only checks the compact source sequence, and TestSessionStartContinueFalseEndsTheTurnNotTheSession only covers continue:false on the startup start. No test sets continue:false on a compact-source SessionStart hook, so this documented variant is unchecked and has no recorded run. The other items are covered: startup, fork, matcher filtering, exit 2 and continue:false at startup. Resume and clear are declared deviations.\nThe files this refusal is about: codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/session_fork_test.go, codex-mock/exec.go, codex-mock/internal/runner/run.go, codex-mock/internal/session/file.go, codex-mock/internal/session/fork.go, codex-mock/snapshots/capture.sh, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork/run.yaml, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork/samples/20261003-145349/SEAL, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork/samples/20261003-145349/events.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork/samples/20261003-145349/exit.txt (and 32 more) (file-guard \"capability-rigor\")\nFINISHED\n\n[exited with code 0]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d757f7e0-1696-4b42-9612-069045d806af","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:01:20.706Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8452fdc1-3ab9-4870-aae8-98a2ef9b1616","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.28