{"parentUuid":"4058b27b-3fba-47c7-977a-a83c90ab9331","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffu7ML7C5SoGwZJ4oA3o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The branch is not pushed and there is no PR: the push gate still wants a clean `sr-checks` run, and one refusal on the `session-start-hook/codex` pair remains. Everything else came back clean in the last run.\n\n**The refusal:** the judge says no test sets `continue: false` on a compact-source SessionStart hook. The Codex doc says that ends the turn, and the mock ignores it there. The `control_compact.go` code that fires the compact start belongs to `manual-compaction/codex`, and there is no recording of the behaviour. My fork test and my compact-source test both avoid it. It counts against my change because I edited `Run` in `codex-mock/internal/runner/run.go`, which carries the `session-start-hook/codex` marker.\n\nI did not implement it myself. Honouring `continue: false` on the compact start is behaviour without a recording, so I'd be guessing what Codex does. Declaring it as a deviation was refused: `modeled-surface` doesn't allow naming a part the mock models, and no other ADR fits.\n\n**Decision for you:** either have the session-start debt agent record and model the compact-start `continue: false` first, after which I rebase and push, or authorize me to implement it from the doc alone.\n\n**Cells (committed locally on `worktree-agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078`, rebased on origin/main `ce617c61`):**\n- **codex × session-fork: supported.** Run `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork`. `exec fork` gives a new session id, a rollout that points at the source instead of copying it, SessionStart source `fork`, and an untouched original. Deviations are declared in the cell.\n- **cursor × session-fork: unsupported.** Run `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork`: `--resume` keeps the same session id and `--fork` is rejected as an unknown option. Docs cited at `https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/parameters#global-options`.\n- **Other cell edited:** the codex `session-start-hook` cell, which now cites `session-fork` and says the mock reports neither the resume nor the clear source.\n\nCursor was recorded with `cursor-agent` 2026.09.28 through a wrapper, because the installed one auto-updated to 2026.10.01 mid-work."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":328509,"output_tokens":1098,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":335},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":704},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1098,"cache_read_input_tokens":328509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":704,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":704,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cffu7Lw3noXj3xhpsZBQN","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ac9a3de3-9949-4428-831e-acbe64ee2b27","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:01:30.254Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-abb30e7cdc8998b15"}
