{"parentUuid":"003b602f-9f8a-4b50-a8a6-6c9097fee60c","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ab2efb1b0554a0078","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffxibrokq6f3VRyuQju3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both `session-fork` cells are done and merged in PR #138 (squash, admin). All CI checks passed first, and the last `sr-checks` run before the push was clean.\n\n- **codex: supported.** `codex exec fork` gives a new session id, and the rollout points back at the original (`forked_from_id`, `history_base`) instead of copying it. SessionStart fires with source `fork`, and the original is untouched. Recorded in `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork`, which also records a resume of the original. The mock handles `exec fork <id>`, with tests marked for both `session-fork/codex` and `session-start-hook/codex`. The cell declares two deviations:\n  - **Fork by reference:** Codex keeps the history by reference rather than in the fork's own file.\n  - **Modeled scope:** the mock models only `exec fork`, and its scripted agent can't read the earlier conversation.\n- **cursor: unsupported.** `cursor-agent` can only resume. `--resume` keeps the same session id, and `--fork` fails with \"unknown option '--fork'\". Recorded in `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/session-fork`. Docs cited at `https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/parameters#global-options`.\n\nThe branch touches other capabilities' shared code in three places:\n- **`Run`:** I edited it in `codex-mock/internal/runner/run.go`. `Run` carries the markers for `session-start-hook/codex` and `noninteractive-run/codex`.\n- **`Create`:** I changed its body in `codex-mock/internal/session/file.go` to delegate to a helper that takes extra meta fields. `Create` carries `sr:provides session-transcript-file/codex`.\n- **`session-start-hook` cell:** I edited the codex cell, adding the `session-fork` run and fork to the list of start sources the mock reports.\n\nI recorded cursor with `cursor-agent` 2026.09.28, the MANIFEST version, using a wrapper in my scratchpad, because the installed one had auto-updated to 2026.10.01."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":237,"cache_read_input_tokens":371679,"output_tokens":699,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":237},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":699,"cache_read_input_tokens":371679,"cache_creation_input_tokens":237,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":237,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffxibTzpqMgxdA9uwZ2g","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"2a95b355-a619-430c-8523-78f0a9014469","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:48:45.314Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab2efb1b0554a0078","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a54d95a1b2ce35f6b"}
